# mm.shell test target

Covers the target-safe mm.shell foundation: CapabilitySet bitset operations,
standard capability profiles, name lookup, static CommandDescriptor Registry
lifecycle and duplicate rejection, IoServices memory sink buffering, and
preflight scratch overflow protection in CommandContext, the embedded scanner
and measured parser, transactional state pools, signed arithmetic, and case
pattern matching, field splitting, parameter resolution, word expansion,
monotonic function storage, and the cooperative evaluator's simple-command
dispatch, assignment semantics, conditionals, loops, case selection, brace
groups, frame budget, control-flow ownership, and output staging, the core
builtin pack's descriptor classes, output, test operators, option
transactions, flow values, and introspection, and Session line accumulation,
multiline continuation, editing bytes, malformed and overlong recovery, and
drain ordering against a blocking transport.
